  lines:
  - speaker: 0
    charonAnimation: CharonSeatedIdle
    charonStareAnimation: CharonStareAtBowley
    bowleyAnimation: BowleyIdle
    text: Nope, the negative Nancy is definitely still here
  - speaker: 1
    charonAnimation: CharonSeatedIdle
    charonStareAnimation: CharonStareAtBowley
    bowleyAnimation: BowleyNo
    text: <wiggle a=.5>Well now that you opened your big mouth, they've tragically
      returned</wiggle>
  - speaker: 0
    charonAnimation: CharonTalkingToBowley
    charonStareAnimation: CharonStareAtBowley
    bowleyAnimation: BowleyIdle
    text: '<shake a=.25>Need I remind you of your controversial stance on- </shake> '
  - speaker: 1
    charonAnimation: CharonTalkingToBowley
    charonStareAnimation: CharonStareAtBowley
    bowleyAnimation: BowleyNoFast
    text: <?CameraShake><shake>GUTTER BALL</shake>
  - speaker: 0
    charonAnimation: CharonSeatedIdle
    charonStareAnimation: CharonStareAtBowley
    bowleyAnimation: BowleyNo
    text: <wiggle a=.25>Bowlie nobody's on-</wiggle>
  - speaker: 1
    charonAnimation: CharonSeatedIdle
    charonStareAnimation: CharonStareAtPlayer
    bowleyAnimation: BowleyYesFast
    text: <?CameraShake><bounce>OH WHAT A BEAUTIFUL SPARE</bounce>
  - speaker: 0
    charonAnimation: CharonComeOn
    charonStareAnimation: CharonStareAtBowley
    bowleyAnimation: BowleyYes
    text: <wiggle a=.25>I'm the only one here that bowls-</wiggle>
  - speaker: 1
    charonAnimation: CharonSeatedIdle
    charonStareAnimation: CharonStareAtBowley
    bowleyAnimation: BowleyIdleFast
    text: <?CameraShake><bounce>IS THAT A STRIKE?!? WOAHHHH!!!</bounce>
  - speaker: 0
    charonAnimation: Null
    charonStareAnimation: CharonStareAtPlayer
    bowleyAnimation: BowleyIdleFast
    text: You see what I have to deal with?
